2. **Project lead roles**: Track the number of projects you're leading versus your peers. Specialized consultants may have more opportunities to lead projects in their area of expertise.
3. **Client feedback**: Monitor client satisfaction ratings and feedback. If clients consistently praise your broad strategic thinking, it may indicate the value of your generalist approach.
